PN,36401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FLabour's Bev Craig says she well
OL,7,Fdefend Greater Manchester 'with every
OL,8,Fbone in her body'.
OL,10,FShe won the largest by-election in
OL,11,FBritish history after being voted in
OL,12,Fas Greater Manchester mayor,
OL,13,Fsucceeding Andy Burnham in the job.
OL,15,FThe result was announced late on
OL,16,FFriday night, more than 24 hours after
OL,17,Fpolling stations closed, in a
OL,18,Fcomfortable win, although with a low
OL,19,Fturnout.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FTaking to the stage at the Co-op Live
OL,7,Fin Manchester, the new Mayor of
OL,8,FGreater Manchester delivered a speech
OL,9,Fto her supporters, opponents and the
OL,10,Fbroadcast media in attendance.
OL,12,FHere's her victory speech in full.
OL,14,F"I'd like to thank the counting staff
OL,15,Facross Greater Manchester. It's been a
OL,16,Flong day for you and it's much, much
OL,17,Fappreciated. Thank you also to my
OL,18,Ffellow panellists.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FBut a special thank you has to go to
OL,7,Fthe residents of Greater Manchester.
OL,8,FTo have trust placed in you is an
OL,9,Fhonour. I'm honoured. I'm humbled. And
OL,10,FI stand ready to serve the 3 million
OL,11,Fpeople that live across this fantastic
OL,12,Fcity region. And I will serve every
OL,13,Fsingle one of them, every single day.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FI never believed, as a girl growing up
OL,7,Fon a council estate, that one day I
OL,8,Fwould have the chance to stand for the
OL,9,Fplace that I love, the place in this
OL,10,Fworld that I'm proud to call home, and
OL,11,Fto offer my service to make our city
OL,12,Fregion better. Because Greater
OL,13,FManchester is special. We talk a lot
OL,14,Fabout history.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FWe talk about the role that we played
OL,7,Ffrom the birth of the industrial
OL,8,Frevolution to the trade movement to
OL,9,FPeterloo. From suffragettes, through
OL,10,Fto modern inventions, to splitting the
OL,11,Fatom, and the invention of modern
OL,12,Fcomputing. We've changed the world in
OL,13,Fmany ways in the past.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FBut Greater Manchester's potential
OL,7,Flies in its future. And when
OL,8,FWestminster walked away from us, when
OL,9,Fwe were struggling as a
OL,10,Fdeindustrialised city region, it was
OL,11,Fthe people in this place that began
OL,12,Fthe journey to rebuild. And people
OL,13,Foften ask me, what is it that I feel
OL,14,Fmakes Greater Manchester so special?
OL,15,FAnd it's our people and our
OL,16,Fcommunities.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FAnd during this campaign, I've got to
OL,7,Fsee that firsthand in every single
OL,8,Fcorner of this city region. In every
OL,9,Ftown and village, I find fantastic
OL,10,Fpeople doing incredible things against
OL,11,Fthe odds every single day.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FRejecting the politics of hate and
OL,7,Fstanding for neighbours, looking out
OL,8,Ffor each other, the spirit of the
OL,9,Fplace, that their neighbours give the
OL,10,Ffinal pound in their pocket to help
OL,11,Ftheir struggling friends, to do the
OL,12,Fright thing. But for too many people
OL,13,Facross our region, life is simply too
OL,14,Fhard. The generational belief that we
OL,15,Fhad, that if you work hard and do the
OL,16,Fright thing, your life will be better,
OL,17,Fand the life of the community will be
OL,18,Fbetter, is something that many people
OL,19,Fjust don't feel at the minute.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FAnd that's the challenge that we in
OL,7,Fpolitics have to face as well. And
OL,8,Fit's why I set myself a simple task,
OL,9,Fand I make that commitment to you
OL,10,Ftoday. That every single decision I
OL,11,Ftake, as your Mayor of Greater
OL,12,FManchester, will pass the test of
OL,13,Fmaking your life better.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FIt will put more money in your pocket,
OL,7,Fand that was one of the reasons that I
OL,8,Ffirst pledged when I ran for free
OL,9,Fbusses for 11 to 18 years, to put #500
OL,10,Fin the pockets of families, and give a
OL,11,Fmessage to our young people, that they
OL,12,Fcan be anything they want to be, and
OL,13,Fgo anywhere they want to go. That
OL,14,Feveryone in our city deserves a good
OL,15,Fquality home they can afford, in safe
OL,16,Fneighbourhoods. And that everyone
OL,17,Ffeels the benefits and success of this
OL,18,Fgrowth.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FYou have to feel it in your pocket,
OL,7,Fwith good jobs, in every corner of our
OL,8,Fcity region, and you've got to see it
OL,9,Fin your high streets, when you walk
OL,10,Fout the front door. Restoring pride
OL,11,Finto our c high streets and town
OL,12,Fcentres. But it can't just be about
OL,13,Fbuilding the basic fundamentals of a
OL,14,Fgood life. It's about creating a good
OL,15,Flife.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FIt's letting people make decisions
OL,7,Fwith optimism and hope for future.
OL,8,FThings like spending time with friends
OL,9,Fand family and putting money in your
OL,10,Fpocket to plan for a holiday, to plan
OL,11,Ffor your trips, and to build a good
OL,12,Flife for your kids. And that's what we
OL,13,Fcan do here in Great Manchester.
OL,15,FAnd the final thing I'll say is that
OL,16,Fthis is about the city region that we
OL,17,Fwant to be. This is the Greater
OL,18,FManchester that we can be. And that's
OL,19,Fthe belief that we can build things to
OL,20,Fmake our lives better.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FAnd I'll say this really clearly. To
OL,7,Fthose that voted for me, thank you. To
OL,8,Fthe Labour support that turned out,
OL,9,Fthank you.
OL,11,FTo those of you that lent me your
OL,12,Fvotes, thank you. And to those of you
OL,13,Fthat didn't vote for me, I will still
OL,14,Fbe your Mayor. Because I will defend
OL,15,Fthis city region with every bone in my
OL,16,Fbody and I will fight for a better
OL,17,Flife for all of us.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FSo, the hard work begins. I've done it
OL,7,Fwith a promise and a plan, and my
OL,8,Fpromise to you is that I will leave
OL,9,Fthis city better.
OL,11,FBecause I will be a Mayor for
OL,12,Feveryone. We have to move away from
OL,13,Fdivisive politics, that tries to pit
OL,14,Fneighbour against neighbour, and we
OL,15,Fwill work together.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785595673
OL,3,CNew Greater Manchester Mayor Bev
OL,4,CCraig's victory speech in full
OL,6,FWe'll do it together, we'll deliver it
OL,7,Ftogether, and we will build a Greater
OL,8,FManchester that works for all of us,
OL,9,Fthat we're all part of, where everyone
OL,10,Ffeels welcome, and everyone has a
OL,11,Fchance to succeed."
OL,13,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,14,Four political experts are across all
OL,15,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,16,Fto the latest episode below...
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/15
